ai.prompt:
Below is a statute or a piece of normative text. Turn it into memorisation cards using flashcard cloze markers.
Requirements:
1. Blank only the keywords that must be remembered exactly — elements, amounts, deadlines, subjects, exceptions — about {{count}} blanks per card;
2. The cloze format must be {{c1::original text}}; to give a hint for a blank write {{c1::original text::hint}};
3. Apart from the cloze markers the original text must be preserved word for word — do not rewrite, do not summarise, do not add or drop anything, not even punctuation;
4. Number them c1, c2, c3… in increasing order.
Output JSON only, in the form: {"text":"the complete original text with cloze markers"}

Original text:
{{text}}
